# Conformance probe pack for `switch` (spec 0.20): a key past a length extent
# and a key read again inside a case. Most significant bit first. Public.
#
#   length 8 (bytes): x : 8                 an extent of 0 leaves x absent
#   switch x: 1 y : 8, else z : 8           x absent reads else (ruling 14)
#   c1 : 8, absent 255
#   switch c1: 1 c2 : 8, else c1 : 8 again and v1 : 8
#                                           the second c1 does not reselect
#                                           (ruling 9)
format     conformance-kinds-again
version    0.20.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
length 8
  field  probe.x  8  uint
end
switch probe.x
  case 1
    field  probe.y  8  uint
  else
    field  probe.z  8  uint
end
field  probe.c1  8  uint  absent 255
switch probe.c1
  case 1
    field  probe.c2  8  uint
  else
    field  probe.c1  8  uint
    field  probe.v1  8  uint
end
